/T (Conclusion: String functions and regular expressions \(Regex\) are important features of JavaScript that make text processing easier and more efficient. String functions can be used to search, compare, split, replace, trim, and change text, while Regex helps identify and work with specific patterns in the given data. These techniques can be applied to email validation, data extraction, keyword searching, and basic text analysis. When combined with HTML for creating the webpage and CSS for styling, JavaScript provides the required functionality to make the application interactive and user-friendly. Overall, learning string functions and Regex provides a strong foundation for handling text- based data and developing practical web applications. )
