/Title (Conclusion : In this experiment, we successfully studied arrays and loops in JavaScript. We implemented different array methods to add, remove, and manipulate elements. We also used map\(\), filter\(\), reduce\(\), and forEach\(\) for array processing. The case study helped us find the maximum and minimum values from an array of numbers and understand the practical use of JavaScript array methods.)
