/Title (Conclusion : In this case study, we successfully implemented an ATM Card PIN Verification System using JavaScript. We learned how to use different types of functions, variable scope, closures, and exception handling. The program validates the entered PIN and displays suitable messages for successful and unsuccessful verification. This activity helped us understand the practical use of JavaScript functions and error handling.)
