/Title (Conclusion: The Smart Cart Total Calculator successfully demonstrates the use of JavaScript arrays, objects, and array methods in a practical application. It calculates item subtotals and the total cart value using forEach\(\) and reduce\(\). The discount logic automatically applies different discounts based on the total amount, and the final payable amount is displayed clearly. This project provides a simple understanding of how JavaScript can be used to create an interactive shopping cart with dynamic calculations.)
/Dest [27 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1771 0 R
/Next 1772 0 R
